{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc25 <strong>Chickout</strong> is a cooperative puzzle\u2013platformer designed for 2\u20136 players. Become part of a team of adorable chicks and overcome challenging obstacles that require timing, coordination, and pure teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play <strong>online or locally</strong>, Chickout offers a hilarious and fun experience where communication is key. A single wrong move can bring the whole team down\u2014but that\u2019s the funny part!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 2-6 player co-op</strong> \u2013 Play online or on the same screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong> \u2013 Simple controls, but teamwork makes it truly challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle\u2013platform gameplay</strong> \u2013 Unlock doors, solve puzzles, and progress together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic fun</strong> \u2013 Laugh at the fails, celebrate the wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute and colorful design</strong> \u2013 Family-friendly, perfect for game nights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickout brings you the madness of co-op gameplay\u2014but this time with quirky little chicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your team hatch the perfect strategy and reach the finish?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985720?t=1771906059","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985720/e691c8df7687938a4fd15e51659035d8dfd3a5b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771906059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985720/15bdf01c50056ad1903ac461fb2ec57f87f6fedd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771906059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985720/15bdf01c50056ad1903ac461fb2ec57f87f6fedd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771906059","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4416120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc25 <strong>Chickout</strong> is a cooperative puzzle\u2013platformer designed for 2\u20136 players. Become part of a team of adorable chicks and overcome challenging obstacles that require timing, coordination, and pure teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play <strong>online or locally</strong>, Chickout offers a hilarious and fun experience where communication is key. A single wrong move can bring the whole team down\u2014but that\u2019s the funny part!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 2-6 player co-op</strong> \u2013 Play online or on the same screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong> \u2013 Simple controls, but teamwork makes it truly challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle\u2013platform gameplay</strong> \u2013 Unlock doors, solve puzzles, and progress together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic fun</strong> \u2013 Laugh at the fails, celebrate the wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute and colorful design</strong> \u2013 Family-friendly, perfect for game nights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickout brings you the madness of co-op gameplay\u2014but this time with quirky little chicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can your team hatch the perfect strategy and reach the finish?</p>","developers":["KankaWorks"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],